# Telangana Clip Analysis using ArcGIS Pro

## Overview

This project demonstrates the use of the Clip geoprocessing tool in ArcGIS Pro to extract Telangana districts from the India District Boundary dataset.

## Objective

To create a separate district boundary dataset for Telangana using the Clip analysis tool.

## Software

- ArcGIS Pro

## Tools Used

- Clip
- Select By Attributes
- Export Features

## Input Data

- India State Boundary
- India District Boundary

## Output

- Telangana State Boundary
- Telangana Districts

## Map Elements

- Title
- Legend
- North Arrow
- Scale Bar
- Neatline

## Workflow

1. Selected Telangana from the India State Boundary.
2. Exported the selected state boundary.
3. Used the Clip tool.
4. Extracted Telangana districts.
5. Styled the map.
6. Created the final layout.

